  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a March 26, 2026 statement, Ryan Billingsley said it is essential to enable banks to adopt technologies such as AI and distributed ledger technology while maintaining expectations that they manage associated risks and operate safely and soundly. In the same statement, he said banks have increasingly used AI and machine learning in areas including fraud detection, AML/CFT processes, and credit underwriting.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In a March 26, 2026 statement, Ryan Billingsley said it is essential to enable banks to adopt technologies such as AI and distributed ledger technology while maintaining expectations that they manage associated risks and operate safely and soundly.",
